            "review_title": "Review at Eat & Go Restaurant",
            "review_text": "458carah\nNottinghamshire, United Kingdom33 contributions\n0\nA great little place for food\nAug 2018 • Couples\nWe were looking for a resturant with good food and that was reasonably priced when we found this place. The owner and her staff were great and really kind. They even gave us a map of the area and genuine recommendations of where to go and what attactions were any good. Also the food was great and very fresh too! It was delicious.\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 30, 2018",
