            "review_title": "Review at Eat & Go Restaurant",
            "review_text": "Joanne T\nMuntinlupa, Philippines3 contributions\n0\nScrumptious Foods\nApr 2018 • Friends\nEverything in this restaurant is awesome!!! The service is one of the greatest. I love the way they took good care of us all when we were there. They are hospitable and too friendly. We feel as if we belong there. Love the foods not too pricey but srcumptious over all. They even offer free drinks ... super love it!!! They even offer freebies which I love most you can choose well thats why I love to eat there for breakfast, lunch and dinner and even just hanging out in that place. Hope to go back there someday and taste the yummy foods that they serve there.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten July 11, 2018",
