            "review_text": "ella b\n5 contributions\n1\nWe visited here everyday for a week!\nJun 2018 • Couples\nMy boyfriend and I have been traveling south East Asia for 3 months, and this is a the best breakfast we’ve had out of our whole trip. We came here every morning for the week that we spent in HCM. The prices are very reasonable, the food is very good and there is lots of choice. My boyfriend had eggs, bacon, beans and homemade chips for 60k every single morning and they discounted us 5% off our bill for recurring visits. We would definitely recommend!\nRead more\nWritten June 28, 2018",
